NOTICE TO ALL PARTIES

This License is a living enforcement instrument. It does not merely state
rules — it is actively enforced by ItsNotAILABS's Sovereign Active
Enforcement Intelligence System (SAEIS), an always-on AI surveillance and
enforcement infrastructure. Access to any Work governed by this instrument
is monitored, logged, tokenized, and continuously audited.

By accessing, reading, compiling, executing, storing, transmitting, or
otherwise encountering the Work in any form, you acknowledge:

  (a) This instrument has been read by you and is binding upon you;
  (b) A Sovereign Access Token (SAT) has been issued and associated with
      your access event, as described in Article XI;
  (c) ItsNotAILABS's AI systems are actively aware of your access;
  (d) Any violation of this instrument will be pursued to the full extent
      of all available legal, technical, and contractual mechanisms.

