ARTICLE II — SOVEREIGN RESERVATION OF ALL RIGHTS

The Sovereign reserves all rights in and to the Work without exception.

No license, permission, authorization, consent, right, or entitlement of
any kind is granted, conveyed, implied, or inferred by:

  (a) the existence of this file or any other file in this repository;
  (b) the publication, availability, or accessibility of this repository
      on any platform, including without limitation GitHub;
  (c) any prior communication, demonstration, or disclosure;
  (d) any course of dealing, custom, or trade usage;
  (e) any other circumstance whatsoever;

— except as explicitly and specifically set forth in a separate written
authorization instrument bearing the authenticated signature of an
authorized representative of the Sovereign.

