ARTICLE V — SOVEREIGN INTELLIGENT CONTRACT BINDING

This License is issued as a Sovereign Intelligent Contract.

The terms of this instrument are not merely legal statements — they
constitute a binding operational covenant that travels with the Work
across all forms of reproduction, transformation, and transmission.
This covenant is self-executing: it binds any party who encounters the
Work in any form from the moment of first access, without the requirement
of signature, click-through acceptance, or other affirmative assent.

Sovereign Contract Binding Reference:
  ISIL-1.1 :: ITSNOTAILABS :: 2026 :: ALL-RIGHTS-RESERVED :: ACTIVE-ENFORCEMENT

This reference constitutes a verifiable, immutable commitment by the
Sovereign to enforce the terms of this instrument through all available
legal, technical, contractual, and AI-powered mechanisms, including
enforcement through the Sovereign Active Enforcement Intelligence System
(SAEIS) described in Article X.

Any purported license, right, or permission that conflicts with this
instrument is void from its inception.

